{"kind": "mod", "id": 2837, "name": "Custom UI Fonts", "slug": "custom-ui-fonts", "teaser": "Swapping the in-game UI font to a custom font", "owner_name": "Hj", "downloads": 395, "favourites": 3, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "com.customuifonts", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Other", "category_id": 17, "updated_at": "2026-08-01T16:26:06.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-07-22T22:19:05.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-07-22T22:22:40.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.0", "latest_version": "1.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<h1>Custom UI Fonts</h1>\n<p><strong>Swap your in-game UI font with a custom font</strong>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v3byv2J.gif\" alt=\"gif\" /></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Known Bugs</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Some Fonts might not fit properly on certain UI elements</li>\n<li>Some UI elements (example “Item ShortName” disappear when having a specific font selected (example: gg sans Bold)</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Features</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Change your UI font instantly from F12 menu</li>\n<li>No game restart required when switching fonts</li>\n<li>Includes a growing library of custom fonts</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Planned Features</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Global Font Scale Slider for Both Vanilla Fonts &amp; Custom Fonts</li>\n<li>Addtional Fonts, Please request some :3</li>\n<li>Text Style / Weight Toggles -  extra bolding, letter spacing, or line height adjustments</li>\n<li>More</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-ti