\"noreferrer noopener\">Minecraft</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://font.download/font/motiva-sans\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Motiva Sans Black &amp; Bold</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Play\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Play Bold</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://fonts.adobe.com/fonts/purista\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Puristratial Bold</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.dafont.com/super-mario-256.font\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Super Mario</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.dafont.com/the-wild-breath-of-zelda.font\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">The Wild Breath of Zelda</a></li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-6\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support/Requests</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Found a bug or have an font request?</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Bug Reports:</strong> Please open an issue on the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/hjal-dev/Custom-UI-Fonts/issues\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GitHub Issues</a> page</li>\n<li><strong>Feature Requests:</strong> Feel free to suggest new features or request additional fonts</li>\n<li><strong>Please avoid posting log files in Forge comments.</strong> GitHub Issues make it much easier to troubleshoot problems</li>\n</ul></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 1881834, "downloads": 395, "published_at": "2026-07-22T22:22:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2837/custom-ui-fonts/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "source_code_links": []}